scenario: Negative expense is rejected before touching the ledger

- TripSettlementService.recordExpense(tripName, expense) !! InvalidExpenseException
  - ExpenseValidator.ensureValid(expense) !! InvalidExpenseException
- TripSettlementService.settleTrip(tripName) → value
  - TripLedger.expensesOf(tripName) → value
  - BalanceCalculator.computeBalances(expenses) → value
  - SettlementPlanner.planTransfers(balances) → value
